-- Zul'Gurub: the Zandalar set and the per-kill raid rewards on every difficulty.
-- Both live videos (youtube c7iqfz04PmI, launch-day Normal; 6ihbw1PKc2E, Ascended 2026-08-04) show
-- Zandalar pieces from the bosses (Thekal: Zandalar Augur's Hauberk; Arlokk: Zandalar Freethinker's
-- Armguards, ilvl 63). The db.exil.es dump of 2026-10-04 has the same 27 pieces at 3.333 % each on the
-- priests, Mandokir and Jin'do, so they drop there on Normal and as each tier's copy (Heroic +300000,
-- Mythic +1300000, Ascended +200000) on the variants. The Battleweaver pieces stay out.
-- Every boss kill in the Normal video gives a Rune of Ascension and two Raider's Commendations to each
-- player, Hakkar six. The runes come as 175 per boss and 2500 from Hakkar in the video, more than a loot
-- row's count holds, so they follow rev_20260930_80_molten_core_loot.sql: one rune per boss.

